Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 09:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] The berry trees beside brought by the picture their berry shows (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The people of the maps beside the player's (patch 0050) are brought
while there's room for their pictures with places left for the game's
own. A berry patch's picture is its berry's at its growth stage, which
the room check didn't know, so it kept room for any: six places free.
Walking up Route 209 into Solaceon Town there were five, so the town's
four berry trees by its south entrance were never brought: they popped
in at the zone change, in sight at the top of the taller field.

Now a berry patch beside is brought by the picture its berry shows
(BerryPatchGraphics_PortPictureOf, from its patch in the save): at once
if that's in already or there's none (nothing planted yet), else with
room for it and places left for the pictures the player's map's own
people may still need (its events' that aren't in: the ones its scripts
bring on) and two more (MapObjectGfx_PortHasRoomForBerry). Everyone
else as before.

---
